<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-dīgestus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unarranged</i>, <i>without order</i>,
				<i>confused</i> (<b>poet.</b> and
			post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(Chaos) rudis indigestaque moles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">simplicitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 15, 30, § 98</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 10, 12, § 65</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multitudo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 6, 31, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of food, <i>undigested</i>, <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7,
				7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 3, 53,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Suffering from indigestion</i>, Schol. <i><span class="en">Juv. 1,
			143</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cael. Aur. Acut. 3, 21,
			198</span></i>.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indīgestē</span></b> ,
				<i>without arrangement</i>, <i>immethodically</i>, Gell. praef. 3; Macr. S. praef. <i>init.</i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
